From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] nuubOS overlay with threaded video, SET_CORE_OPTION command

- The performance overlay line (patch 0004) was added to the frame info
  in video_driver_frame only; with video_threaded the video thread
  builds its own frame info, so the overlay never showed (NDS sessions
  run threaded). video_driver_nuubos_osd adds it in both places.
- SET_CORE_OPTION <key> <value> sets a core option of the running core
  like its menu does (the core sees it at its next variable update and
  RetroArch saves it with the other options), for the session manager's
  live shortcuts. Replies "SET_CORE_OPTION OK|FAILED".

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [nuubOS specific]
---
--- a/gfx/video_driver.c
+++ b/gfx/video_driver.c
@@ -560,6 +560,38 @@
    return lines;
 }
 
+/* nuubOS performance overlay: white text with a dark shadow at the
+ * bottom left, about 15 px high on a 480-line screen (scaled with the
+ * output), wrapped between items onto as many lines as the width needs
+ * (they grow upwards), through the statistics path (RetroArch's own
+ * statistics win). At the bottom it stays clear of a picture cropped at
+ * the sides and of the top of the game (user request 2026-10-11).
+ * Called for every frame the driver draws: by video_driver_frame, and by
+ * the threaded video wrapper, which builds its own frame info (with
+ * video_threaded the overlay was never drawn: NDS sessions). */
+void video_driver_nuubos_osd(video_frame_info_t *video_info)
+{
+   if (     !video_info->statistics_show
+         && nuubos_osd_text[0])
+   {
+      float scale    = ((float)video_info->height / 480.0f)
+            * (15.0f / video_info->font_size);
+      unsigned lines = nuubos_osd_wrap(video_info->stat_text,
+            sizeof(video_info->stat_text), video_info->width, scale);
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.x           = 0.012f;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.y           = (8.0f + 19.0f * (lines - 1)) / 480.0f;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.text_align  = TEXT_ALIGN_LEFT;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.scale       = scale;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.full_screen = true;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.drop_x      = 1;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.drop_y      = -1;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.drop_mod    = 0.0f;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.drop_alpha  = 1.0f;
+      video_info->osd_stat_params.color       = COLOR_ABGR(255, 255, 255, 255);
+      video_info->statistics_show             = true;
+   }
+}
